# Environment variables for oracle_engine MCP server
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The .env file will be automatically discovered when running your server,
# even from subdirectories like src/oracle_engine/.
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit your .env file to version control!

# No secrets required yet. The scaffold's example `whisper_secret` tool
# (and the secret variable it read) were removed on sight before the first
# commit — irrelevant to this server's real purpose, per oracle/SCOPES.md.
# When task 31's real read/search tools land (Tavily MCP for search), any
# API keys they need get documented here, not before.
